      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:ap.124.monbeg",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲱ ⲛⲁⲙⲉⲛⲣⲁϯ ⲉϥⲧⲟⲩⲛⲟⲥ **ⲉϩⲣⲏⲓ** ⲙⲫⲣⲱⲟⲩⲧϥ ⲙⲡⲁϩⲏⲧ ⲉⲑⲣⲉⲛϭⲓⲫⲉⲓ ϧⲁⲡⲓⲣⲁϣⲓ ⲙⲡⲛⲉⲩⲙⲁⲧⲓⲕⲟⲛ ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲛⲧⲁϯⲙⲡⲁⲟⲩⲟⲓ ⲉϧⲟⲩⲛ ⲉⲛⲉϥⲉⲅⲕⲱⲓⲟⲛ ⲉⲑⲟⲩⲁⲃ",
      "english": "O dearly beloved, it excites the gladness of our hearts, to rejoice in spiritual joy and to undertake its holy encomium.",
      "source": "Life of Isaac of Alexandria - part 1",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.boh_isaac.amelineau_ed:1-19",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁϥⲉⲓ **ⲉϩⲣⲁⲓ** ⲉϫⲛⲟⲩⲕⲁⲧⲁⲅⲁⲓⲟⲛ ·",
      "english": "and he came to the cell of a monk,",
      "source": "Life of Cyrus in Budge ed. part 1",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.cyrus.budge:1-9",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
